# `tests/` — Verification and synthetic fixtures

## Authority

The root [`README.md`](../README.md) contract governs placement.

Tests belong here. `tests/fixtures/` contains only small, synthetic, openly
Git-trackable inputs created to exercise code and pipeline behavior. A fixture is
not acquired evidence and must never be copied into `data/raw/` or described as
a real sample.

Unit and property tests cover reusable `src/` behavior. Integration tests cover
catalog/config resolution, declared pipeline paths, storage rules, provenance,
and operator-command failure safety. Tests should fail loudly and should not
depend on local secrets, ignored user data, network services, or scratch notes.
